+###### `S-095` `binding_web_report`
+
+**Programme.** `S-095` · scope `platform_shared` · feature `F14` · build order 3146 · batch `B2` · review `unreviewed` — Shared rendering infrastructure: the renderer every web REPORT page draws through.
+
+**What it is.** The web REPORT renderer: ReportPage.tsx draws the v21 report page view (sections, parts, the detail sheet, the footer) for the MaxBLD report page; ReportView.tsx draws the earlier report view and the Picture; ReportPageToggles.tsx is the client toggle script of the page. It is the landed renderer Spec 126 section 11b.1 keeps ("REPORT keeps the landed renderer"); it is a component, not a library binding.
+
+**What it reads and writes.** It reads nothing itself: the page passes the page view (built and checked on the server by buildPage / pageViewOf) and the content strings.
